{"seq":3,"slug":"policy-evaluation","title":"大学公共管理 — 政策评估","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/public-policy/policy-evaluation","wordCount":1882,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学公共管理-政策评估\">大学公共管理 — 政策评估</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>政策评估是对已实施政策的效果、效率和影响进行系统性判断的过程。它回答的根本问题是：这项政策实现了预期目标吗？产生了哪些预期之外的后果？公共资源是否得到了合理使用？政策评估不仅是政策循环的终点，更是下一轮政策改进的起点。</p>\n<p>政策评估的核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>形成性评估（Formative Evaluation）</strong>：在政策执行过程中进行，旨在改善执行</li>\n<li><strong>总结性评估（Summative Evaluation）</strong>：在政策完成后进行，判断政策是否成功</li>\n<li><strong>内部效度（Internal Validity）</strong>：评估结论是否准确反映了政策的因果效应</li>\n<li><strong>外部效度（External Validity）</strong>：评估结论能否推广到其他情境</li>\n<li><strong>反事实（Counterfactual）</strong>：如果没有实施该政策，情况会怎样</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"政策评估的基本逻辑-因果推断\">政策评估的基本逻辑：因果推断</h3><p>政策评估的核心挑战是因果推断——我们需要判断观察到的变化有多少归因于政策干预，多少来自其他因素。理想的评估需要比较两种状态：实施政策后的实际结果与未实施政策时的&quot;反事实&quot;结果。</p>\n<p>用形式化语言表达，设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_i(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为个体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 接受政策干预后的结果，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_i(0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为未接受干预的结果。政策对个体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的因果效应为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_i = Y_i(1) - Y_i(0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由于同一个体不可能同时处于接受和未接受干预两种状态（&quot;因果推断的根本问题&quot;），我们无法直接观测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，只能估计群体层面的<strong>平均处理效应</strong>（Average Treatment Effect, ATE）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATE = E[Y(1) - Y(0)] = E[Y(1)] - E[Y(0)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"实验方法-随机对照试验\">实验方法：随机对照试验</h3><p>随机对照试验（Randomized Controlled Trial, RCT）是因果推断的&quot;金标准&quot;。通过随机分配，确保处理组和对照组在所有可观测和不可观测特征上统计等价，从而消除选择偏误。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估方法</th>\n<th>内部效度</th>\n<th>外部效度</th>\n<th>实施难度</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机对照试验</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准实验设计</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回归分析</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定性评估</td>\n<td>取决于设计</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在公共政策领域，RCT 的应用日益广泛。诺贝尔经济学奖得主 Banerjee 和 Duflo 通过大量田野实验评估了发展中国家的教育、卫生和扶贫政策效果。例如，他们在印度的实验发现，给学生提供补习教师比减小班级规模更能提高学业成绩——这一结论直接影响了多国的教育政策设计。</p>\n<h3 id=\"准实验方法\">准实验方法</h3><p>当随机化不可行或不合伦理时，准实验方法（quasi-experimental designs）提供了替代方案：</p>\n<p><strong>双重差分法（Difference-in-Differences, DID）</strong> 是政策评估中最常用的准实验方法。其基本思路是比较处理组和对照组在政策实施前后的变化差异：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\tau}_{DID} = (\\bar{Y}_{T,post} - \\bar{Y}_{T,pre}) - (\\bar{Y}_{C,post} - \\bar{Y}_{C,pre})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 代表处理组，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 代表对照组。DID 的关键假设是&quot;平行趋势&quot;——如果没有政策干预，两组的变化趋势相同。</p>\n<p><strong>断点回归设计（Regression Discontinuity Design, RDD）</strong> 利用政策资格的临界值（如贫困线、分数线）来识别因果效应。恰好在临界值两侧的个体特征几乎相同，但政策待遇截然不同，形成了&quot;自然实验&quot;的条件。</p>\n<p><strong>倾向得分匹配（Propensity Score Matching, PSM）</strong> 通过估计每个个体接受干预的概率（倾向得分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e(X) = P(D=1|X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），为处理组中的每个个体找到特征相似的对照个体，从而构造可比较的对照组。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[政策评估方法选择] --&gt; B{能否随机分配?}&#10;    B --&gt;|能| C[RCT]&#10;    B --&gt;|不能| D{是否有自然临界值?}&#10;    D --&gt;|有| E[断点回归 RDD]&#10;    D --&gt;|没有| F{是否有前后对照?}&#10;    F --&gt;|有| G[双重差分 DID]&#10;    F --&gt;|没有| H[倾向得分匹配 PSM]\">graph LR\n    A[政策评估方法选择] --&gt; B{能否随机分配?}\n    B --&gt;|能| C[RCT]\n    B --&gt;|不能| D{是否有自然临界值?}\n    D --&gt;|有| E[断点回归 RDD]\n    D --&gt;|没有| F{是否有前后对照?}\n    F --&gt;|有| G[双重差分 DID]\n    F --&gt;|没有| H[倾向得分匹配 PSM]</pre><h3 id=\"评估标准的多元维度\">评估标准的多元维度</h3><p>政策评估不仅关注效果（effectiveness），还需考虑多个维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>效率（Efficiency）</strong>：投入产出比是否合理？单位成本是否可接受？</li>\n<li><strong>公平（Equity）</strong>：政策受益是否在不同群体间公平分配？是否加剧了已有的不平等？</li>\n<li><strong>回应性（Responsiveness）</strong>：政策是否回应了目标群体的真实需求？</li>\n<li><strong>可持续性（Sustainability）</strong>：政策效果在干预结束后能否持续？</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在评估实践中，效率与公平之间经常存在张力。例如，一项扶贫政策可能整体效率最优的方案是集中资源于脱贫最容易的群体，但这恰恰忽视了最需要帮助的极端贫困人口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"中国的政策评估实践\">中国的政策评估实践</h3><p>中国的政策评估体系正在快速发展。&quot;十四五&quot;规划明确要求建立健全政策评估制度，各级政府逐步引入第三方评估。然而，挑战依然显著：评估的独立性不足、数据开放程度有限、评估结果对政策调整的反馈机制尚不完善。</p>\n<p>近年来，中国学者在政策评估方法上取得了重要进展。例如，利用&quot;新农合&quot;（新型农村合作医疗）的分阶段推广，采用 DID 方法评估医疗保险对农村居民健康和消费行为的影响；利用&quot;撤点并校&quot;政策的地区差异，运用 RDD 评估学校合并对学生学业表现的因果效应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>假设某市在部分社区试点了&quot;老年人免费体检&quot;政策。请设计一个双重差分评估方案：明确处理组和对照组、前后测量时间点以及需要控制的变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么简单地比较参加职业培训项目者和未参加者的就业率，不能说明项目有效。&quot;选择偏误&quot;在这个案例中如何体现？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某扶贫政策规定人均年收入低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4000</span></span></span></span></span> 元的家庭可享受补贴。如果你要评估该政策对家庭消费的影响，RDD 是否适用？请分析其优势和局限。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论&quot;形成性评估&quot;与&quot;总结性评估&quot;的时机选择：在哪些情况下，形成性评估比总结性评估更有价值？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Rossi, P. H. et al. <em>Evaluation: A Systematic Approach</em>——政策评估的综合教材，覆盖从设计到实施的全流程</li>\n<li>Angrist, J. &amp; Pischke, J. <em>Mostly Harmless Econometrics</em>——因果推断方法的通俗讲解，对准实验方法的阐述尤为清晰</li>\n<li>Banerjee, A. &amp; Duflo, E. <em>Poor Economics</em>——以田野实验为基础的发展政策评估，获诺贝尔奖</li>\n<li>中国财政科学研究院《政策评估方法论》——了解中国政策评估的制度框架</li>\n<li>Campbell Collaboration（campbellcollaboration.org）——系统评价和元分析的开放资源库</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>政策评估的本质是回答&quot;如果没有这项政策会怎样&quot;这个反事实问题。从 RCT 到 DID、RDD 和 PSM，不同方法在内部效度、外部效度和可行性之间做出不同的权衡。好的评估不仅需要方法论功底，更需要对政策情境的深入理解——知道何时用什么方法、如何解读结果中的不确定性。作为自学者，建议从一个具体的政策案例入手，尝试用一种准实验方法进行分析，在实践中真正理解因果推断的思维方式。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学公共管理 — 政策评估","id":"大学公共管理-政策评估"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"政策评估的基本逻辑：因果推断","id":"政策评估的基本逻辑-因果推断"},{"level":3,"text":"实验方法：随机对照试验","id":"实验方法-随机对照试验"},{"level":3,"text":"准实验方法","id":"准实验方法"},{"level":3,"text":"评估标准的多元维度","id":"评估标准的多元维度"},{"level":3,"text":"中国的政策评估实践","id":"中国的政策评估实践"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学公共管理 — 政策执行","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/public-policy/policy-implementation"},"next":{"title":"大学公共管理 — 官僚制理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/public-administration/government-management/bureaucratic-theory"}}